# Agile V Infinity Loop (CodeBook E-Commerce)

**Every prompt:** load `agile-v-core` → `agile-v-pipeline` → `agile-v-lifecycle` (C2+) → role skill (`.agile-v/SKILLS.md`) → `agile-v-compliance` (gates).

## Resume (read first)

1. `.agile-v/STATE.md` — cycle, stage, verify baseline
2. `.agile-v/CHECKPOINTS.md` — only if PENDING HITL
3. `.agile-v/REQUIREMENTS.md` — parent `REQ-XXXX` before any artifact

## Pipeline

```
Specify → Constrain → [Gate1] → Orchestrate → Prove → Verify → [Gate2] → Accept
         ↑___________________________________________________________|
```

## Halt if

- No parent REQ in `REQUIREMENTS.md`
- Ambiguous or conflicting REQ
- Build agent self-verifies only (no Red Team for R2/R3)
- Gate 2 without `EVAL_RESULTS.md` `eval_gate_status: PASS` (or WAIVED + APPROVALS)
- Skip TanStack Query invalidation on CRUD
- Coolify/VPS deploy without explicit user ask

## Traceability

`REQ-XXXX` → `ART-XXXX` → `TC-XXXX` → `VER-XXXX` → append `DECISION_LOG.md`

## Verify (default)

```bash
npx tsc -b && npx eslint src
cd backend && npx tsc --noEmit
npm run build
```

## Engineering (repo)

Strict TypeScript · shared hooks/services/ui · invalidate all affected query keys on mutations · page width from `App.tsx` `max-w-9xl` only · no Redis/SSR · never commit/push unless asked · SPA + TanStack Query is the cache story

